<component type="desktop-application">
  <id>io.github.dprietob.luma</id>

  <name>Luma</name>
  <summary>Real-time multitrack audio mixer</summary>
  <summary xml:lang="es">Mezclador de audio multipista en tiempo real</summary>

  <metadata_license>CC0-1.0</metadata_license>
  <project_license>GPL-3.0-or-later</project_license>

  <developer id="io.github.dprietob">
    <name>Daniel Prieto</name>
  </developer>

  <description>
    <p>
      Luma is a real-time multitrack audio mixer for Linux with the look and feel
      of a professional studio tool. Play many audio channels at once and control
      each one independently.
    </p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Independent per-channel playback of WAV, MP3, OGG and FLAC files</li>
      <li>Per-channel volume, pan, fades and looping</li>
      <li>Effects per channel: reverb, delay, distortion, pitch and speed, plus a graphic equalizer</li>
      <li>Main and auxiliary outputs, routed independently</li>
      <li>Presets (scenes) and node-graph automation flows</li>
      <li>Projects stored in a portable folder, with imported tracks copied alongside</li>
    </ul>
    <p xml:lang="es">
      Luma es un mezclador de audio multipista en tiempo real para Linux con
      estética de herramienta profesional de estudio. Reproduce muchos canales de
      audio a la vez y controla cada uno de forma independiente.
    </p>
  </description>

